## What I Learned

### AI Can Evaluate Content Objectively

Instead of relying only on manual reviews, AI can quickly identify strengths, weaknesses, and optimization opportunities across multiple content dimensions.

### Better Content Requires Multiple Metrics

Readability, engagement, clarity, and structure all contribute to content quality. Evaluating them together provides more meaningful insights.

### Dashboards Improve Feedback

Visualizing analysis results makes it easier to understand content performance and prioritize improvements.

### Prompt Engineering Enhances Evaluation

Well-designed prompts enable AI to provide detailed, practical, and actionable feedback instead of generic suggestions.

